# MAESTRO SWRL Rule — Capability Inference
#
# If a ControlComponent controls a Resource and implements a Skill, and
# a Capability is realized by that Skill, then the Resource can perform the
# Capability.
#
# This is the core inference that turns a static plant description into a
# capability-annotated knowledge graph.
#
# Prefixes:
#   core: http://example.org/maestro/core#
#
# SWRL rule (Manchester-style):

Resource(?r) ^
ControlComponent(?c) ^
controls(?c, ?r) ^
implements(?c, ?s) ^
Skill(?s) ^
Capability(?cap) ^
realizedBySkill(?cap, ?s)
-> canPerform(?r, ?cap)
